        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8003EBUS19, Black Porcelain Knobset with White Porcelain Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Black and White Porcelain Knobset looks like it came strait out of the glitz and glamor of the 1920's. This Porcelain Door Knobset features a Black Porcelain Knob with White Porcelain rose for a stunning monochrome set that is sure to catch eyes. This retro door knob will fit 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick with backsets of either 2-3/4 inches or 2-3/8 inches. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Retro Porcelain Ebony Knob with White Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Monochrome Porcelain Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Finish: Black Porcelain</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Finish: White Porcelain</li>\r\n<li>Center Ring in Rosette Finish: Matte Black</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Steam: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Black and White Porcelain Knobset",
                "description": "The Black and White Porcelain Knobset looks like it came strait out of the glitz and glamor of the 1920's. This Porcelain Door Knobset features a Black Porcelain Knob with White Porcelain rose for a stunning monochrome set that is sure to catch eyes. This retro door knob will fit 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick with backsets of either 2-3/4 inches or 2-3/8 inches. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
